# Uploaded files are not committed. New uploads (news, products, about, editor, ...)
# stay on the server only and must be covered by the storage backup.
#
# Files committed before this rule (36 site images) are still tracked on purpose:
# untracking them with `git rm --cached` would delete them from the server on the
# next `git pull`. Only this file is tracked here for new content.
*
!.gitignore
